<h2>1. About this website</h2><p>This website introduces RDB Building Services LTD, the trading style used here by R D B BUILDING SERVICES LTD, company number 16900008, registered in England and Wales. <a href="https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/16900008" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the Companies House record</a>.</p><p>The business location is Unit 1, Newlands Farm, Newlands Lane, The Royal Town of Sutton Coldfield, Curdworth, Sutton Coldfield B76 0BE, United Kingdom. Email: <a href="mailto:info@rdbbuildingservices.co.uk">info@rdbbuildingservices.co.uk</a>. Telephone: coming soon. The website domain is rdbbuildingservices.co.uk.</p>
<h2>2. Information and project suitability</h2><p>Service pages provide general information and ideas for a project brief. They do not constitute an offer, a specification, a quotation, planning advice or a confirmation that a proposed use is suitable for your site. Availability, location, dimensions, design, approvals and the scope of work must be discussed individually.</p><p>Planning, building control and operating requirements depend on your proposal and location. UK nations have different rules. Consult the relevant authority and appropriately qualified advisers where needed.</p>
<h2>3. Enquiries, quotations and contracts</h2><p>The website does not accept orders or payments. Submitting an enquiry asks us to contact you about your project; it does not place an order or create a contract for goods or building work. Enquiries are processed through FormSubmit and forwarded to our business email address.</p><p>Any supply of goods or building services will need a separate written agreement covering the specification, price, VAT, programme, payment, delivery, installation and responsibilities. Consumer cancellation rights, guarantees and any other applicable statutory rights must be addressed in the terms relevant to the transaction. These website terms do not replace those terms or remove statutory rights.</p>
<h2>4. Photographs and descriptions</h2><p>Photographs are illustrative stock or reference images and are not presented as evidence of completed RDB projects. Colours, finishes, layouts and equipment shown are examples, not included specifications. Rights in photographs, branding and other material remain with their respective owners.</p><p>You may view this website and keep a copy of information for your personal project research. Do not republish images or branding without the relevant owner’s permission. Nothing on this website grants a licence to use third-party photographs.</p>
<h2>5. Responsible use</h2><p>Do not attempt to disrupt the website, introduce malicious code or obtain unauthorised access. Take reasonable steps to protect your device and any downloaded files. We may update content or functionality as the site develops.</p>
<h2>6. External websites</h2><p>Links to guidance and mapping services are provided for convenience. Those websites are operated independently and have their own terms and privacy practices. Check that any guidance applies to your project and remains current.</p>
<h2>7. Responsibility and your rights</h2><p>We aim to keep information useful and accurate, but general website material cannot answer every site-specific question. Check important details with RDB before relying on them for an order or other commitment.</p><p>Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability for fraud, fraudulent misrepresentation, death or personal injury caused by negligence, or any liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited. Nothing here affects your mandatory consumer rights.</p>
